WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.776
A précis is a shorter

2
00:00:01.776 --> 00:00:03.549
version of a passage.

3
00:00:03.549 --> 00:00:05.126
Usually about a third of

4
00:00:05.126 --> 00:00:06.380
its length.

5
00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:07.735
Read it twice,

6
00:00:07.735 --> 00:00:09.512
and find the central idea.

7
00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:12.108
Cut the examples and repetition.

8
00:00:12.108 --> 00:00:13.417
Then write it in your

9
00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:14.139
own words,

10
00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.299
and count.

11
00:00:15.627 --> 00:00:17.308
Aim for about one-third of

12
00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.474
the original.

13
00:00:18.474 --> 00:00:20.431
The paper usually states the

14
00:00:20.431 --> 00:00:21.806
exact limit.

15
00:00:22.139 --> 00:00:24.369
Never add your own opinion.

16
00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:25.882
A précis only says what

17
00:00:25.882 --> 00:00:27.024
the author said,

18
00:00:27.024 --> 00:00:28.070
shorter.

19
00:00:28.759 --> 00:00:29.985
Your turn.

20
00:00:29.985 --> 00:00:31.549
How long should a précis

21
00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:32.332
be?
